;custom code, profile translation
@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K111()
CALL M_KOJO_COLOR_K111
PRINTFORML %nameArray:111:na_Title%
RESETCOLOR
PRINTL 
PRINTFORML A fairy who lives in Hell. Loves to play even more than eating three meals a day.
PRINTFORML She is honest, obedient, pure and innocent to those who are friendly and caring. She is also vain and likes to show off.
PRINTFORML However, if she happens to deal with a difficult person, she responds in a blunt manner,
PRINTFORML but on the other hand, she speaks in a proper tone with someone she respects.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML Hecatia is her master and guardian.
PRINTFORML Because she was born in Hell, she is stronger than most fairies and has the knowledge and mannerisms of a junior high school student.
