;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	PRINTL 
	PRINTFORMDL As the two of you walk home from your date, you notice Clownpiece slowly taking out her torch for some reason.
	PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMW 「Hey hey, do you wanna see what happens if I use my power on you for real, %CALLNAME:MASTER%?」
