		ELSEIF TALENT:111:思慕
			PRINTFORMW 「'Cuz, I mean, I totally～ tricked you, and, um...」
			CALL HPH_PRINT,@"「Besides, it was with you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%, you knowHPH」","W"
			CSTR:111:ファーストキス喪失履歴 = %PRINT_DATE_F(DAY)%, on the way home from the date at %DATENAME_PLACE()%, she mischievously gave her first kiss to her best bud %CALLNAME:MASTER%.
