			PRINTFORMW 「I d-don't know if this is the right time to bring this up, but...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Umm... You know! %CALLNAME:MASTER%!」
			PRINTFORML 「I love you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%!!」
			PRINTL 
			FORCEWAIT 
			PRINTFORMW 「Well, I've always gotten along with you, but recently it's turned into something different!」
			PRINTFORMW 「Like, I'd say it's an even bigger love... Or maybe a love that I can't resist...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Yeah! I fell in love with %CALLNAME:MASTER% for real!」
			PRINTFORMW 「I really wanted to get that off my chest... I've been dying to tell you for a long time now...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Hey, %CALLNAME:MASTER%, do you... Like me too...?」
			PRINTL 
		;以降
		ELSE
			PRINTL 
			PRINTFORMDL On the way home from your date, Clownpiece stops and gives you a searching look before opening her mouth...
			PRINTW 
			PRINTFORMW 「Hey, %CALLNAME:MASTER%...」
			PRINTFORMW 「You're, um... Still not dating anyone yet, right...?」
			PRINTL 
			PRINTFORMDL Surprised by the wavering uncertainty in your heart, you just stand there, at a loss for words.
			PRINTFORMDL Sensing your indecision, Clownpiece seizes the initiative and opens her mouth first.
			PRINTW 
			PRINTFORMW 「I-I've always liked you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%, ever since that time!」
			PRINTFORMW 「So, that's why... If you just give me your answer, then I can...」
		ENDIF
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白オッケー（恋人が付く）
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		;初めての返答（お断りしてない）
		IF FIRSTTIME("返答")
			PRINTFORMW 「Really!?」
			PRINTFORMW 「You fell in love with me too, %CALLNAME:MASTER%!?」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「R-Really!?」
			PRINTFORMW 「You started liking me too, %CALLNAME:MASTER%!?」
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMW 「Kyahaa♪ I'm so happy～!!」
		PRINTL 
		PRINTFORMDL Unable to contain her joy, Clownpiece hops and skips around with a smile covering her whole face.
		PRINTFORMDL Channeling her overflowing energy, she leaps at you in excitement...
		PRINTFORMDL You catch her in both hands, blocking her flying tackle and turning it into a hug.
		PRINTFORMDL Clownpiece eagerly returns it, buring her face in your chest and rubbing her cheeks back and forth against you.
		PRINTW 
		CALL HPH_PRINT,@"「MfffーHPH I luvvv you %CALLNAME:MASTER%～HPH Pfahaha～♪」","W"
		PRINTFORMW 「Hey, is it okay if we stay this way for a bit longer...?」
		PRINTL 
		;雪
		IF GROUPMATCH(天候, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13)
			PRINTFORMDW The two of you spend a long moment together, sharing the warmth of each others' bodies as you hug――
		;雨
		ELSEIF GROUPMATCH(天候, 4, 5, 6, 7)
			PRINTFORMDW The two of you spend a long moment together, taking in the sound of the rain as you hug one another――
		;早朝～昼
		ELSEIF INRANGE(TIME, 240, 899)
			PRINTFORMDL The two of you spend a long moment together, enjoying each others' happiness.
			PRINTFORMDW As if blessing your union, the sun casts only a single shadow for the both of you――
			;地の文に合わせるために勝手に天気を変える,まぁ変わるのほぼ曇りだけなんで
			天候 = 0
		;夕方
		ELSEIF INRANGE(TIME, 900, 1140)
			PRINTFORMDL Your two shadows, cast long by the setting sun,
			PRINTFORMDW Unite as one as you share each others' happiness――
			天候 = 0
		;夜
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL The two of you spend a long moment together, sharing in each others' happiness...
			PRINTFORMDW Under the quite moonlight, you unite as one――
			天候 = 0
		ENDIF
		PRINTL 
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白失敗
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
		;初めてのお断り
		IF FIRSTTIME("返答")
			PRINTFORMW 「I see... Ummm, it's alright...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Because, at least I was able to get my feelings out into the open...」
			PRINTFORMW 「I was able to tell you how I've been feeling, %CALLNAME:MASTER%, so it's like I was able to take a load off my chest...」
			PRINTL 
			PRINTFORMDL Clownpiece continually rubs her eyes, as if trying to prevent them from overflowing with tears.
			PRINTFORMDL She shakes her head, takes a deep breath and pulls herself together.
			PRINTW 
			PRINTFORMW 「W-Well that's a shame! You know, it's such a shock that I can't help but cry... But...」
			PRINTFORMW 「But, it's also true that I feel refreshed!」
			PRINTFORMW 「And besides, you don't have anyone you're in love with yet, right %CALLNAME:MASTER%?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Then, I'll keep doing my best until %CALLNAME:MASTER% falls in love with me!」
			PRINTFORMW 「So, let's keep on playing together lots and lots, okay!」
		;お断り二回目以降
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「I see... Ummm, it's alright...」
			PRINTFORMW 「But, you're not sure of yourself, are you? In that case, I'm not gonna give up!」
			PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, as long as you still want to keep playing with me, then I'll have faith that you'll come around sooner or later!」
		ENDIF
		PRINTL 
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1

